    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nViewings suspended.\n\nREA MURPHY is delighted to bring this four-bedroom detached bungalow to the open market for immediate sale. Set on approximately 0.5 acres of beautifully mature gardens, the property offers exceptional privacy, stunning countryside views, and a highly sought-after location just minutes from the Dublin/Kildare border.\n\nSituated on the foothills of the Wicklow Mountains and just off the N81, Lisheen Road enjoys the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and commuter convenience, with Citywest Business Campus just a 10-minute drive away and Sandyford, West Dublin, and North Kildare all easily accessible.\n\nOccupying an elevated site, the residence is approached via a gravel driveway and enjoys a particularly private setting overlooking the surrounding countryside. Built in 1974 by the current owner, who has lovingly maintained the property for over 50 years, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a well-cared-for family home in a truly desirable location.\n\nThe beautifully established split-level gardens have been thoughtfully designed to create a series of inviting destination points, showcasing a rich variety of colourful herbaceous planting, mature shrubs and trees, and a sheltered vegetable garden area. Bursting with seasonal colour, the gardens provide a peaceful setting for relaxation and outdoor enjoyment. An elevated patio overlooks the grounds and surrounding countryside, offering the perfect spot to unwind while taking in spectacular sunsets.\n\nThe accommodation comprises four bedrooms, a family bathroom, a comfortable lounge, an open-plan kitchen and living area, a utility room, and a guest WC.\n\nThe residence is 1km from Manor Kilbride Village, on the edge of the Blessington Lakes. It has a well-established and supportive community, with newly developed GAA facilities providing a central hub for sports and social amenities for both children and adults. Lisheen Road Montessori School and Manor Kilbride Primary School are within close proximity, while Blessington provides secondary schools, shopping, and a wider range of amenities only 7.5 km away.\n\nFor outdoor enthusiasts, the area offers endless opportunities for walking, hiking, cycling, sailing, and other recreational pursuits. Lisheen Springs Golf Club is located just 2.5 km from the property.\n\nCombining privacy, mature gardens, countryside tranquillity, excellent amenities, and outstanding connectivity to Dublin, this property presents a rare opportunity to enjoy the very best of country living without compromising convenience.\n\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended. Viewings strictly by appointment through REA Murphy.\n\n \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hall.\n\nLounge.\n\nKitchen and living area. \n\nUtility room with W.C.\n\n4 Bedrooms: 3 Double Bedrooms. 1 Single Bedroom.\n\nBathroom with separate W.C. \n\nThe residence is presented in its original style and offers excellent scope for modernisation, allowing the incoming purchaser to create a space tailored to their own requirements and taste.\n\nOUTSIDE:\n\nFront gardens: Fully matured shrubbery and trees with a fully established front boundary ensuring total privacy. Gravelled driveway.\n\nRear Gardens: An enclosed sun trap area which can be easily integrated with the residence to become a significant recreation space.\n\nGarage: Valuable storage area.\n\n \n\nSERVICES:\n\nPrivate well water supply (no fluoride added), private septic tank sewerage system, oil-fired central heating and alarm system\n\nThe property also benefits from fibre broadband availability, a solid fuel stove in the living room, and an oil-fired AGA range cooker in the kitchen.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
