        "Content": "A 4-bed family home, with detached garage, on a mature site.\nRural setting within the established Manor Kilbride community.\n10-minute drive from West Dublin.\nBeautiful views from an elevated setting and total privacy from the public road.\nWater sports, GAA, Golf and outdoor pursuits on your immediate doorstep.\nLocal services in Manor Kilbride village and Blessington Town (7.5Km)."
